{"name":"Intensity Manila: Anime City — Day 1","aliases":["Intensity Manila Anime City BSK Raveclub 2026","Intensity Anime City dark circuit Manila"],"city":"manila","date":"2026-10-02","start_date":"2026-10-02","end_date":"2026-10-03","description":"Intensity Manila opens Anime City on its darker setting: hard circuit pressure, tech house, techno and cosplay imagination turned loose in a Mandaluyong rave-room.","link":"https://whereto.party/events/intensity-manila-anime-city/mandaluyong-city","ticket_url":"https://whereto.party/events/intensity-manila-anime-city/mandaluyong-city","location":"BSK Raveclub, Sheridan, Greenfield District, Mandaluyong City 1550, Metro Manila, Philippines","lat":14.5778,"lng":121.0562,"vibe":"dark-circuit Manila opener with techno, tech house and anime cosplay energy","intel":{"hours":"Friday 2 October 2026; confirm door and closing times in the active ticket channel.","entry_wait":"This is the first half of a two-night circuit weekend; buy through the named event channel and allow for costume/security checks.","best_arrival":"Arrive close to doors to catch the darker techno/tech-house identity before the floor reaches peak rave density.","crowd_mix":"Manila circuit dancers, anime and cosplay fans, electronic-music regulars and guests joining the two-night Intensity community.","dress_code":"Cosplay is encouraged across Anime City. Pick a look that can handle heat and continuous movement in a dark-circuit room.","host_inclusivity":"Intensity Manila is an established gay circuit brand whose weekend is framed around diversity, dance and shared self-expression.","lineup":"Day 1 is billed as techno, tech house and dark circuit; final artist schedule is released via Intensity Manila.","age_limit":"Confirm through ticketing before attending.","source_urls":["https://whereto.party/events/intensity-manila-anime-city/mandaluyong-city","https://www.gaytravel4u.com/event/intensity-manila-circuit-event/"],"research_status":"event_listing_date_full_