{"name":"Intensity Manila: Anime City — Day 2","aliases":["Intensity Manila Anime City Stratosphere 2026","Intensity Anime City circuit Makati"],"city":"manila","date":"2026-10-03","start_date":"2026-10-03","end_date":"2026-10-04","description":"Anime City turns full colour for Intensity Manila’s second night: big-room circuit, house, bodies in cosplay and a Makati finale built to be louder than its own storyline.","link":"https://whereto.party/events/intensity-manila-anime-city/makati-city","ticket_url":"https://whereto.party/events/intensity-manila-anime-city/makati-city","location":"Stratosphere Events Place, 4/F Century Mall, Kalayaan Avenue corner Salamanca Street, Makati City 1209, Metro Manila, Philippines","lat":14.5657,"lng":121.0302,"vibe":"full-colour Makati circuit finale with house, big-room lift and anime-cosplay release","intel":{"hours":"Saturday 3 October 2026; confirm door and closing times in the active ticket channel.","entry_wait":"The venue sits on Century Mall’s fourth floor; secure the event ticket ahead and build in time for mall/venue entry before the second-night rush.","best_arrival":"Come early enough to see the cosplay field before the big-room programme pulls the crowd toward the main floor.","crowd_mix":"Circuit-party regulars, local and visiting LGBTQ+ dancers, house fans and anime-cosplay guests continuing from the Mandaluyong opener.","dress_code":"Come as a favourite anime character or use imaginative cosplay—Anime City explicitly encourages both.","host_inclusivity":"Intensity Manila’s circuit programme is presented as an LGBTQ+ community celebration focused on diversity, high-energy dance culture and self-expression.","lineup":"Day 2 is billed as house, big room and circuit; final artist schedule is released via Intensity Manila.","age_limit":"Confirm through ticketing before attending.","source_urls":["https://whereto.party/events/intensity-manila-anime-city/makati-city","https://www.ticketmax.ph/venues/stratosphere-events-plac