{"name":"Lazberry","aliases":["Lazberry FLINTA Seoul October 2026","Lazberry at Nyapi Melting 99"],"city":"seoul","date":"2026-10-01","start_date":"2026-10-01","end_date":"2026-10-02","description":"Lazberry makes Nyapi a Seoul FLINTA* living room with real sub-bass: Melting 99’s cold digital swing, local selectors and a floor built for care without killing the edge.","link":"https://ra.co/events/2545012","ticket_url":"https://ra.co/events/2545012","location":"Nyapi, 187 Itaewon-ro, Yongsan-gu, Seoul, South Korea","lat":37.5343,"lng":126.9945,"vibe":"FLINTA*-centred Itaewon electronic night with house, tech-house and a care-first underground floor","intel":{"hours":"22:00 Thursday 1 October–04:00 Friday 2 October 2026.","entry_wait":"Entry is listed at ₩15,000; buy or confirm through the live organiser/RA channel and bring photo ID for the 18+ check.","best_arrival":"Arrive for 22:00 to settle into Nyapi before the compact floor reaches its fuller late-night energy.","crowd_mix":"Women, lesbians, intersex, non-binary, trans and agender dancers, alongside people who actively respect the FLINTA*-centred space.","dress_code":"No fixed look is published; functional clubwear and self-expression are a better fit than treating the room as a costume obligation.","host_inclusivity":"Lazberry explicitly centres FLINTA* identities and its mutual-care culture, while Nyapi presents itself as a genre-open home for freedom and community.","lineup":"Melting 99, Kugel, Soyo, Uni and YAREE.","age_limit":"18+.","source_urls":["https://ra.co/events/2545012"],"research_status":"ra_date_hours_full_address_lineup_price_age_and_flinta_policy_verified","updated_at":"2026-09-26T00:00:00Z"}},
{"name":"RGB Golden Week: Unleash × Shadow × Bearism","aliases":["RGB Pride Party Golden Week Bangkok 2026","Unleash Shadow Bearism Hook Up BKK"],"city":"bangkok","date":"2026-10-02","start_date":"2026-10-02","end_date":"2026-10-03","description":"RGB makes Bangkok Golden Week sweat on purpose: a Pride circuit party with an underwear zone, a full dance floor and no interest in shrinking desire down to polite small talk.","link":"https://megatix.in.th/events/rgb-golden-week-unleash-x-shadow-x-bearism","ticket_url":"https://megatix.in.th/events/rgb-golden-week-unleash-x-shadow-x-bearism","location":"Hook Up BKK, 37/5 2nd Floor, Surawong Road, Suriyawong, Bang Rak, Bangkok 10500, Thailand","lat":13.7283,"lng":100.5332,"vibe":"Bangkok Pride circuit heat: underwear-zone confidence, late dance-floor release and Golden Week spectacle","intel":{"hours":"22:00 Friday 2 October–05:00 Saturday 3 October 2026.","entry_wait":"Ticket tiers run from early-bird through door sale; use Megatix before travelling and expect the semi-underwear theme to make pre-entry preparation worthwhile.","best_arrival":"Come for 22:00 to use both the underwear and dance zones before the late-night circuit crowd fills the room.","crowd_mix":"Bangkok Pride-party regulars, bear and circuit communities, friends seeking a sexy queer dance floor and visitors who respect the event’s body-positive setting.","dress_code":"Semi-underwear is the stated dress code. Build a look that feels bold while remaining comfortable and respectful in a crowded club.","host_inclusivity":"The event is produced by RGB Pride Party and explicitly framed as a Pride experience with distinct body-positive social and dance spaces.","lineup":"Unleash × Shadow × Bearism collaborative Pride programme; confirm DJ and performance roster through the live ticket page.","age_limit":"20+.","source_urls":["https://megatix.in.th/events/rgb-golden-week-unleash-x-shadow-x-bearism"],"research_status":"official_ticketing_date_hours_full_address_a