{"name":"GEGEN × HORNBKK","aliases":["GEGEN X HORNBKK Bangkok October 2026","Gegen Horn Bangkok techno 2026"],"city":"bangkok","date":"2026-10-24","start_date":"2026-10-24","end_date":"2026-10-25","description":"GEGEN and HORNBKK bring Berlin-born queer fetish gravity to Silom: hard-breathing techno, performance bodies and an XXL play area for a Bangkok night that refuses to stay on the safe side of the room.","link":"https://ra.co/events/2502998","ticket_url":"https://ra.co/events/2502998","location":"Horn, 4th Floor, 71–73 Silom 4 Alley, Suriya Wong, Bang Rak, Bangkok 10500, Thailand","lat":13.7302,"lng":100.5324,"vibe":"queer-fetish techno in Silom: Berlin pressure, performance bodies and a purpose-built play space","intel":{"hours":"22:00 Saturday 24 October–03:00 Sunday 25 October 2026.","entry_wait":"Presale is limited and door tickets are listed only with dress code; buy early and read the current event guidance before heading to Horn.","best_arrival":"Reach the club around 22:00 for easier entry and time to understand the venue’s sound, performance and play-space boundaries.","crowd_mix":"Bangkok queer nightlife, fetish and leather communities, GEGEN travellers, techno devotees and guests who opt in to an erotic performance setting.","dress_code":"A door ticket requires dress code. Fetish styling is appropriate; choose gear you can safely wear and dance in while following venue consent rules.","host_inclusivity":"GEGEN is a queer-fetish party framework, and the Horn collaboration explicitly couples techno, performance and play spaces rather than treating sexuality as decoration.","lineup":"Sound: 5.5MM, Cristian Marras and Mar/us. Bodies: Aisin, Beer and Snooker.","age_limit":"Confirm with promoter and ticketing before attending.","source_urls":["https://ra.co/events/2502998"],"research_status":"ra_date_hours_full_address_lineup_genre_and_dress_code_requirement_verified","updated_at":"2026-09-26T00:00:00Z"}}
